      "html" : "<\/div><div style=\"margin-bottom=10pt\">&#160;<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-174037\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-174037\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"Small\"><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ta.&#160;&#160;&#160;For requirements for occupancies in Group I-2, see Sections 407.2 and 407.3.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-174038\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-174038\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"Small\"><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tb.&#160;&#160;&#160;For a reduction in the fire-resistance rating for occupancies in Group I-3, see Section 408.8.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-174039\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-174039\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"Small\"><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tc.&#160;&#160;&#160;Buildings equipped throughout with an automatic sprinkler system in accordance with Section 903.3.1.1 or 903.3.1.2 where allowed.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-174040\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-174040\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"Small\"><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\td.&#160;&#160;&#160;Interior corridors within dwelling or sleeping units in Group R occupancies pursuant to Section 1020.1.1, Exception 2 shall not require fire-resistance rating.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><\/div>",
      "id" : "16243-html-3",
      "kind" : "html",
      "plainText" : "a. For requirements for occupancies in Group I-2, see Sections 407.2 and 407.3.\n\n b. For a reduction in the fire-resistance rating for occupancies in Group I-3, see Section 408.8.\n\n c. Buildings equipped throughout with an automatic sprinkler system in accordance with Section 903.3.1.1 or 903.3.1.2 where allowed.\n\n d. Interior corridors within dwelling or sleeping units in Group R occupancies pursuant to Section 1020.1.1, Exception 2 shall not require fire-resistance rating."
